# Keeps Docker build contexts small for every image built from the repo root.
# Images only need sources, package manifests, and the lockfile; all local
# tooling state stays out of `docker build`.

.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage

# Local tooling, docs, and test artifacts that no image needs.
.browsers
test-results
playwright-report
docs
e2e
README.md
PLAN.md
